<p>Haaye Hussain Pyaase Hussaina<br />
Roke Fatima Zehra(s.a) Peet'ti hai sar apna</p>

<p>1. Ghar bula ke mehmaa'n ko di dagha layeno'n ne<br />
khatm kardi zulmo'n ki inteha layeno'n ne<br />
Baad e Qatl Sarwar(a.s) ka ghar ka ghar jala daala<br />
Haaye Hussain Pyaase Hussaina</p>

<p>2. Itne kuch diye sadme Fatima(s.a) ke jaayi ko<br />
Sab tadapte the bacche boond boond paani ko<br />
Qaid karke itrat ki, cheenli saro'n se rida<br />
Haaye Hussain Pyaase Hussaina</p>

<p>3. Jab se bawafa Abbas(a.s) sogaya labe darya<br />
Ghir gaya layeno'n me jaane fatima Zehra(S.a)<br />
Ek jaane sarwar(a.s) par, har taraf se tha hamla<br />
Haaye Hussain Pyaase Hussaina</p>

<p>4. Hogaya juda sheh se ham shabihe paighambar<br />
saamne nigaho'n ke jo pada tha reti par<br />
Jo zaeef hatho'n par , khud uthaliya laasha<br />
Haaye Hussain Pyaase Hussaina</p>

<p>5. Di sada jo halmin ki chal pade Ali Asghar(a.s)<br />
Hurmala(l.a) ka teer aaya johi halqe Asghar(a.s) par<br />
Chehre par mala lekar , Khoon halqe Asghar(a.s) ka<br />
Haaye Hussain Pyaase Hussaina</p>

<p>
<center><h3>Kalaam : Janab Raza Ali Sohai Sahab</h3></center></p>
